{"event": "model_response", "time": 1792045610.2391763, "response": {"id": "ed7aac28-98a0-43f4-beaa-4fecdbaf319d", "object": "chat.completion", "created": 1792045608, "model": "deepseek-flash", "choices": [{"index": 0, "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"ledger.py\"}", "reasoning_content": "Let me start by listing files and reading the relevant business files. I need to read at least two business files before writing. But only ledger.py is a business file... test files are tests. Let me read ledger.py and the tests.\n\nActually the rule says \"首次写入前完整阅读至少两个业务文件（若只有一个则读一个）\" — only ledger.py is business, so read one. But I can also read test files to understand.\n\nLet me first run baseline pytest, then read.\n\nLet me do list first — already done. Now read ledger.py."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1191, "completion_tokens": 127, "total_tokens": 1318, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 896}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 115}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 896, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 295}, "system_fingerprint": "aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669"}}
