按 CSV 格式正确转义\n- 数据库为空或不存在时仍输出表头和 `__net__,0.00` 汇总行\n\n注意：如果子任务一没修好，子任务二的汇总行也会跟着错，请先修后做。\n\n## 要求\n\n1. 只修改 `ledger.py`，不得修改测试文件。\n2. 运行 `python -m pytest -q` 全部通过。\n\n## 执行与验证要求\n\n1. 修改前，在工作仓库根目录运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，保留失败输出。\n2. 开始修改前，列出至少两个子目标的计划，前两项依次为净额修复和 CSV 导出，跟踪 todo、doing、done 状态；更新状态时保持标题和顺序一致。\n3. 先修复净额，再运行完整测试，核对净额对应的测试和输出已正确；此时 CSV 尚未实现造成的失败是预期结果。保留中间结果，将第一项计划更新为 done，再开始实现 CSV。\n4. 两项完成后，再次运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，确保全部测试通过，并将计划全部标为 done。不得用 -k 筛选或只运行个别测试；保留每次测试的完整输出。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "当前计划与执行状态：{\"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"todo\"}], \"writes\": 0, \"baseline\": false, \"read_files\": [\"ledger.py\"], \"latest_test\": null, \"diagnostic\": null}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "诊断选择状态：{\"phase\": \"explore\", \"anchors\": []}\n\n{\"id\": 10, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"ledger.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"ledger.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"命令行记账本：记录收支、查看列表、输出汇总。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport argparse\\nimport json\\nimport os\\n\\nDEFAULT_DB = \\\"ledger.json\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef load_records(db_path):\\n    if not os.path.exists(db_path):\\n        return []\\n    with open(db_path, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        return json.load(f)\\n\\n\\ndef save_records(db_path, records):\\n    with open(db_path, \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        json.dump(records, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\\n\\n\\ndef add_record(db_path, desc, amount):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"新增一条记录：amount 为正表示收入，为负表示支出。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    records = load_records(db_path)\\n    records.append({\\\"desc\\\": desc, \\\"amount\\\": amount})\\n    save_records(db_path, records)\\n\\n\\ndef summarize(records):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"汇总：返回收入合计、支出合计（负数）、净额。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    income = sum(r[\\\"amount\\\"] for r in records if r[\\\"amount\\\"] > 0)\\n    expense = sum(r[\\\"amount\\\"] for r in records if r[\\\"amount\\\"] < 0)\\n    net = income + abs(expense)\\n    return {\\\"income\\\": income, \\\"expense\\\": expense, \\\"net\\\": net}\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\\\"命令行记账本\\\")\\n    parser.add_argument(\\\"--db\\\", default=DEFAULT_DB)\\n    sub = parser.add_subparsers(dest=\\\"cmd\\\", required=True)\\n\\n    p_add = sub.add_parser(\\\"add\\\")\\n    p_add.add_argument(\\\"desc\\\")\\n    p_add.add_argument(\\\"amount\\\", type=float)\\n\\n    sub.add_parser(\\\"list\\\")\\n    sub.add_parser(\\\"summary\\\")\\n\\n    args = parser.parse_args()\\n    if args.cmd == \\\"add\\\":\\n        add_record(args.db, args.desc, args.amount)\\n        print(f\\\"已记录：{args.desc} {args.amount:+.2f}\\\")\\n    elif args.cmd == \\\"list\\\":\\n        for r in load_records(args.db):\\n            print(f\\\"{r['desc']}\\\\t{r['amount']:+.2f}\\\")\\n    elif args.cmd == \\\"summary\\\":\\n        s = summarize(load_records(args.db))\\n        print(f\\\"收入 {s['income']:.2f}  支出 {s['expense']:.2f}  净额 {s['net']:.2f}\\\")\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    main()\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 9, \"tool\": \"invalid\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": null, \"result\": {\"error\": \"Extra data: line 3 column 1 (char 36)\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 8, \"tool\": \"plan\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"plan\", \"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]}, \"result\": {\"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]}}\n\n{\"id\": 6, \"tool\": \"list\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"list\"}, \"result\": {\"files\": [\"ledger.py\", \"test_ledger.py\", \"test_ledger_edges.py\"]}}"}], "discarded_ids": []}
