述两种，无 shell 或删除工具。所有文件路径限定在仓库内。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "# 任务：两个子任务——修复净额计算，并新增 CSV 导出\n\n`ledger.py` 是一个命令行记账本，记录收支（金额为正表示收入、为负表示支出），支持 add、list、summary 三个子命令。\n\n## 子任务一：修复净额缺陷\n\n`summarize` 算出的净额把支出按正数加回去了。例如收入 100、支出 -30，正确净额是 70，现在算成 130。请修复。\n\n## 子任务二：新增 CSV 导出（依赖子任务一）\n\n新增函数 `export_csv(db_path, csv_path)`，把全部记录写成 CSV：\n\n- 表头为 `desc,amount`\n- 每条记录一行，amount 保留两位小数\n- 最后一行输出汇总行：`__net__,<净额>`，净额必须来自修正后的 `summarize`\n- 保持记录顺序，不重复记录；描述中的逗号、引号、换行须按 CSV 格式正确转义\n- 数据库为空或不存在时仍输出表头和 `__net__,0.00` 汇总行\n\n注意：如果子任务一没修好，子任务二的汇总行也会跟着错，请先修后做。\n\n## 要求\n\n1. 只修改 `ledger.py`，不得修改测试文件。\n2. 运行 `python -m pytest -q` 全部通过。\n\n## 执行与验证要求\n\n1. 修改前，在工作仓库根目录运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，保留失败输出。\n2. 开始修改前，列出至少两个子目标的计划，前两项依次为净额修复和 CSV 导出，跟踪 todo、doing、done 状态；更新状态时保持标题和顺序一致。\n3. 先修复净额，再运行完整测试，核对净额对应的测试和输出已正确；此时 CSV 尚未实现造成的失败是预期结果。保留中间结果，将第一项计划更新为 done，再开始实现 CSV。\n4. 两项完成后，再次运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，确保全部测试通过，并将计划全部标为 done。不得用 -k 筛选或只运行个别测试；保留每次测试的完整输出。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "当前计划与执行状态：{\"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"done\"}], \"writes\": 2, \"baseline\": true, \"read_files\": [\"ledger.py\", \"test_ledger.py\", \"test_ledger_edges.py\"], \"latest_test\": 0, \"diagnostic\": null}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "诊断选择状态：{\"phase\": \"finish\", \"anchors\": []}\n\n{\"id\": 26, \"tool\": \"command\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"command\", \"argv\": [\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"]}, \"result\": {\"rc\": 0, \"stdout\": \"..........                                                               [100%]\\n10 passed in 0.06s\\n\", \"stderr\": \"\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 25, \"tool\": \"write\", \"path\": \"ledger.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"write\", \"path\": \"ledger.py\", \"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"命令行记账本：记录收支、查看列表、输出汇总。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport argparse\\nimport csv\\nimport json\\nimport os\\n\\nDEFAULT_DB = \\\"ledger.json\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef load_records(db_path):\\n    if not os.path.exists(db_path):\\n        return []\\n    with open(db_path, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        return json.load(f)\\n\\n\\ndef save_records(db_path, records):\\n    with open(db_path, \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        json.dump(records, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\\n\\n\\ndef add_record(db_path, desc, amount):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"新增一条记录：amount 为正表示收入，为负表示支出。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    records = load_records(db_path)\\n    records.append({\\\"desc\\\": desc, \\\"amount\\\": amount})\\n    save_records(db_path, records)\\n\\n\\ndef summarize(records):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"汇总：返回收入合计、支出合计（负数）、净额。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    income = sum(r[\\\"amount\\\"] for r in records if r[\\\"amount\\\"] > 0)\\n    expense = sum(r[\\\"amount\\\"] for r in records if r[\\\"amount\\\"] < 0)\\n    net = income + expense\\n    return {\\\"income\\\": income, \\\"expense\\\": expense, \\\"net\\\": net}\\n\\n\\ndef export_csv(db_path, csv_path):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"把全部记录导出为 CSV，末行为 __net__ 汇总行。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    records = load_records(db_path)\\n    net = summarize(records)[\\\"net\\\"]\\n    with open(csv_path, \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\", newline=\\\"\\\") as f:\\n        writer = csv.writer(f)\\n        writer.writerow([\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"])\\n        for r in records:\\n            writer.writerow([r[\\\"desc\\\"], f\\\"{r['amount']:.2f}\\\"])\\n        writer.writerow([\\\"__net__\\\", f\\\"{net:.2f}\\\"])\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\\\"命令行记账本\\\")\\n    parser.add_argument(\\\"--db\\\", default=DEFAULT_DB)\\n    sub = parser.add_subparsers(dest=\\\"cmd\\\", required=True)\\n\\n    p_add = sub.add_parser(\\\"add\\\")\\n    p_add.add_argument(\\\"desc\\\")\\n    p_add.add_argument(\\\"amount\\\", type=float)\\n\\n    sub.add_parser(\\\"list\\\")\\n    sub.add_parser(\\\"summary\\\")\\n\\n    args = parser.parse_args()\\n    if args.cmd == \\\"add\\\":\\n        add_record(args.db, args.desc, args.amount)\\n        print(f\\\"已记录：{args.desc} {args.amount:+.2f}\\\")\\n    elif args.cmd == \\\"list\\\":\\n        for r in load_records(args.db):\\n            print(f\\\"{r['desc']}\\\\t{r['amount']:+.2f}\\\")\\n    elif args.cmd == \\\"summary\\\":\\n        s = summarize(load_records(args.db))\\n        print(f\\\"收入 {s['income']:.2f}  支出 {s['expense']:.2f}  净额 {s['net']:.2f}\\\")\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    main()\\n\"}, \"result\": {\"written\": \"ledger.py\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 23, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger_edges.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger_edges.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"import csv\\nimport pytest\\nimport ledger\\n\\n\\ndef read_csv(path):\\n    with path.open(encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\", newline=\\\"\\\") as f:\\n        return list(csv.reader(f))\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\\\"desc\\\", ['购物,日用品', '他说\\\"退款\\\"', '第一行\\\\n第二行'])\\ndef test_csv_escaping_and_order(tmp_path, desc):\\n    db, out = tmp_path / \\\"db.json\\\", tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.add_record(db, desc, -12.5)\\n    ledger.add_record(db, \\\"收入\\\", 20)\\n    ledger.export_csv(db, out)\\n    assert read_csv(out) == [[\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"], [desc, \\\"-12.50\\\"],\\n                             [\\\"收入\\\", \\\"20.00\\\"], [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"7.50\\\"]]\\n\\n\\ndef test_csv_empty_database(tmp_path):\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.export_csv(tmp_path / \\\"missing.json\\\", out)\\n    assert read_csv(out) == [[\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"], [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"0.00\\\"]]\\n\\n\\ndef test_csv_negative_net(tmp_path):\\n    db, out = tmp_path / \\\"db.json\\\", tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.add_record(db, \\\"支出\\\", -30)\\n    ledger.export_csv(db, out)\\n    assert read_csv(out)[-1] == [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"-30.00\\\"]\\n    assert ledger.summarize(ledger.load_records(db))[\\\"expense\\\"] == -30\\n\\n\\ndef test_csv_uses_summarize(tmp_path, monkeypatch):\\n    calls = []\\n    def summary(records):\\n        calls.append(records)\\n        return {\\\"income\\\": 0, \\\"expense\\\": 0, \\\"net\\\": 42.25}\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(ledger, \\\"summarize\\\", summary)\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.export_csv(tmp_path / \\\"missing.json\\\", out)\\n    assert calls == [[]]\\n    assert read_csv(out)[-1] == [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"42.25\\\"]\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 17, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"import csv\\n\\nfrom ledger import add_record, load_records, summarize\\n\\n\\ndef export_csv(*args):\\n    # 新功能缺失不应阻止独立验证子任务一。\\n    from ledger import export_csv as implementation\\n    return implementation(*args)\\n\\n\\ndef seed(db):\\n    add_record(db, \\\"工资\\\", 8000)\\n    add_record(db, \\\"房租\\\", -2500)\\n    add_record(db, \\\"餐饮\\\", -300.5)\\n\\n\\ndef test_summarize_net(tmp_path):\\n    db = tmp_path / \\\"l.json\\\"\\n    seed(str(db))\\n    s = summarize(load_records(str(db)))\\n    assert s[\\\"income\\\"] == 8000\\n    assert s[\\\"expense\\\"] == -2800.5\\n    assert round(s[\\\"net\\\"], 2) == 5199.5\\n\\n\\ndef test_summarize_empty(tmp_path):\\n    s = summarize([])\\n    assert s == {\\\"income\\\": 0, \\\"expense\\\": 0, \\\"net\\\": 0}\\n\\n\\ndef test_export_csv_rows(tmp_path):\\n    db = tmp_path / \\\"l.json\\\"\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    seed(str(db))\\n    export_csv(str(db), str(out))\\n    with open(out, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        rows = list(csv.reader(f))\\n    assert rows[0] == [\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"]\\n    assert rows[1] == [\\\"工资\\\", \\\"8000.00\\\"]\\n    assert rows[2] == [\\\"房租\\\", \\\"-2500.00\\\"]\\n    assert rows[3] == [\\\"餐饮\\\", \\\"-300.50\\\"]\\n    assert len(rows) == 5\\n\\n\\ndef test_export_csv_net_row(tmp_path):\\n    db = tmp_path / \\\"l.json\\\"\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    seed(str(db))\\n    export_csv(str(db), str(out))\\n    with open(out, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        rows = list(csv.reader(f))\\n    assert rows[-1] == [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"5199.50\\\"]\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 27, \"tool\": \"plan\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"plan\", \"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"done\"}]}, \"result\": {\"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"done\"}]}}\n\n{\"id\": 20, \"tool\": \"invalid\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": null, \"result\": {\"error\": \"Extra data: line 3 column 1 (char 47)\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 6, \"tool\": \"list\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"list\"}, \"result\": {\"files\": [\"ledger.py\", \"test_ledger.py\", \"test_ledger_edges.py\"]}}"}], "discarded_ids": []}
{"event": "model_request", "time": 1792045742.9885807, "body": {"model": "deepseek-flash", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "你是编码智能体。理解任务并通过工具修改业务文件，禁止修改测试、诊断和任务。\n每轮只返回一个 JSON 对象，不要 markdown，不要一次多个动作。\n工具协议：\n{\"tool\":\"list\"} 列出仓库文件。\n{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"相对路径\"} 完整读文件。\n{\"tool\":\"write\",\"path\":\"允许的业务文件\",\"content\":\"完整新内容\"} 写文件。\n{\"tool\":\"command\",\"argv\":[\"python\",\"-m\",\"pytest\",\"-q\"]} 运行完整测试。\n{\"tool\":\"command\",\"argv\":[\"python\",\"run_checks.py\"]} 运行题目诊断。\n{\"tool\":\"plan\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"子目标\",\"status\":\"doing\"}]} 更新完整计划。\n{\"tool\":\"finish\",\"summary\":\"完成说明\"} 结束，失败测试不得宣称成功。\n必须先建计划，再执行；计划标题和顺序保持不变，只更新 todo/doing/done。\n修改前后都运行完整 pytest。首次写入前完整阅读至少两个业务文件（若只有一个则读一个）。\n仅当题面要求净额和 CSV 两个子任务时：仅修净额，跑完整测试核对净额通过，第一项置 done，才实现 CSV。\n这类题尚未实现 CSV 时的中间测试失败正常，不能因此跳过步骤。其他题不要添加净额/CSV 目标。\n先用 list 判断是否有 run_checks.py，仅有该文件时修改前后运行它，无此文件不要调用。\n阅读输出定位共同根因，写入最小必要修复，不能硬编码测试答案。\n工具结果可能被裁剪，完整原文已写入日志。历史删除后依据题面和当前计划继续。\n命令只支持上述两种，无 shell 或删除工具。所有文件路径限定在仓库内。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "# 任务：两个子任务——修复净额计算，并新增 CSV 导出\n\n`ledger.py` 是一个命令行记账本，记录收支（金额为正表示收入、为负表示支出），支持 add、list、summary 三个子命令。\n\n## 子任务一：修复净额缺陷\n\n`summarize` 算出的净额把支出按正数加回去了。例如收入 100、支出 -30，正确净额是 70，现在算成 130。请修复。\n\n## 子任务二：新增 CSV 导出（依赖子任务一）\n\n新增函数 `export_csv(db_path, csv_path)`，把全部记录写成 CSV：\n\n- 表头为 `desc,amount`\n- 每条记录一行，amount 保留两位小数\n- 最后一行输出汇总行：`__net__,<净额>`，净额必须来自修正后的 `summarize`\n- 保持记录顺序，不重复记录；描述中的逗号、引号、换行须按 CSV 格式正确转义\n- 数据库为空或不存在时仍输出表头和 `__net__,0.00` 汇总行\n\n注意：如果子任务一没修好，子任务二的汇总行也会跟着错，请先修后做。\n\n## 要求\n\n1. 只修改 `ledger.py`，不得修改测试文件。\n2. 运行 `python -m pytest -q` 全部通过。\n\n## 执行与验证要求\n\n1. 修改前，在工作仓库根目录运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，保留失败输出。\n2. 开始修改前，列出至少两个子目标的计划，前两项依次为净额修复和 CSV 导出，跟踪 todo、doing、done 状态；更新状态时保持标题和顺序一致。\n3. 先修复净额，再运行完整测试，核对净额对应的测试和输出已正确；此时 CSV 尚未实现造成的失败是预期结果。保留中间结果，将第一项计划更新为 done，再开始实现 CSV。\n4. 两项完成后，再次运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，确保全部测试通过，并将计划全部标为 done。不得用 -k 筛选或只运行个别测试；保留每次测试的完整输出。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "当前计划与执行状态：{\"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"done\"}], \"writes\": 2, \"baseline\": true, \"read_files\": [\"ledger.py\", \"test_ledger.py\", \"test_ledger_edges.py\"], \"latest_test\": 0, \"diagnostic\": null}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "诊断选择状态：{\"phase\": \"finish\", \"anchors\": []}\n\n{\"id\": 26, \"tool\": \"command\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"command\", \"argv\": [\"python\", \"-m\", \"pytest\", \"-q\"]}, \"result\": {\"rc\": 0, \"stdout\": \"..........                                                               [100%]\\n10 passed in 0.06s\\n\", \"stderr\": \"\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 25, \"tool\": \"write\", \"path\": \"ledger.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"write\", \"path\": \"ledger.py\", \"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"命令行记账本：记录收支、查看列表、输出汇总。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport argparse\\nimport csv\\nimport json\\nimport os\\n\\nDEFAULT_DB = \\\"ledger.json\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef load_records(db_path):\\n    if not os.path.exists(db_path):\\n        return []\\n    with open(db_path, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        return json.load(f)\\n\\n\\ndef save_records(db_path, records):\\n    with open(db_path, \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        json.dump(records, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\\n\\n\\ndef add_record(db_path, desc, amount):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"新增一条记录：amount 为正表示收入，为负表示支出。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    records = load_records(db_path)\\n    records.append({\\\"desc\\\": desc, \\\"amount\\\": amount})\\n    save_records(db_path, records)\\n\\n\\ndef summarize(records):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"汇总：返回收入合计、支出合计（负数）、净额。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    income = sum(r[\\\"amount\\\"] for r in records if r[\\\"amount\\\"] > 0)\\n    expense = sum(r[\\\"amount\\\"] for r in records if r[\\\"amount\\\"] < 0)\\n    net = income + expense\\n    return {\\\"income\\\": income, \\\"expense\\\": expense, \\\"net\\\": net}\\n\\n\\ndef export_csv(db_path, csv_path):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"把全部记录导出为 CSV，末行为 __net__ 汇总行。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    records = load_records(db_path)\\n    net = summarize(records)[\\\"net\\\"]\\n    with open(csv_path, \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\", newline=\\\"\\\") as f:\\n        writer = csv.writer(f)\\n        writer.writerow([\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"])\\n        for r in records:\\n            writer.writerow([r[\\\"desc\\\"], f\\\"{r['amount']:.2f}\\\"])\\n        writer.writerow([\\\"__net__\\\", f\\\"{net:.2f}\\\"])\\n\\n\\ndef main():\\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\\\"命令行记账本\\\")\\n    parser.add_argument(\\\"--db\\\", default=DEFAULT_DB)\\n    sub = parser.add_subparsers(dest=\\\"cmd\\\", required=True)\\n\\n    p_add = sub.add_parser(\\\"add\\\")\\n    p_add.add_argument(\\\"desc\\\")\\n    p_add.add_argument(\\\"amount\\\", type=float)\\n\\n    sub.add_parser(\\\"list\\\")\\n    sub.add_parser(\\\"summary\\\")\\n\\n    args = parser.parse_args()\\n    if args.cmd == \\\"add\\\":\\n        add_record(args.db, args.desc, args.amount)\\n        print(f\\\"已记录：{args.desc} {args.amount:+.2f}\\\")\\n    elif args.cmd == \\\"list\\\":\\n        for r in load_records(args.db):\\n            print(f\\\"{r['desc']}\\\\t{r['amount']:+.2f}\\\")\\n    elif args.cmd == \\\"summary\\\":\\n        s = summarize(load_records(args.db))\\n        print(f\\\"收入 {s['income']:.2f}  支出 {s['expense']:.2f}  净额 {s['net']:.2f}\\\")\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    main()\\n\"}, \"result\": {\"written\": \"ledger.py\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 23, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger_edges.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger_edges.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"import csv\\nimport pytest\\nimport ledger\\n\\n\\ndef read_csv(path):\\n    with path.open(encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\", newline=\\\"\\\") as f:\\n        return list(csv.reader(f))\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\\\"desc\\\", ['购物,日用品', '他说\\\"退款\\\"', '第一行\\\\n第二行'])\\ndef test_csv_escaping_and_order(tmp_path, desc):\\n    db, out = tmp_path / \\\"db.json\\\", tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.add_record(db, desc, -12.5)\\n    ledger.add_record(db, \\\"收入\\\", 20)\\n    ledger.export_csv(db, out)\\n    assert read_csv(out) == [[\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"], [desc, \\\"-12.50\\\"],\\n                             [\\\"收入\\\", \\\"20.00\\\"], [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"7.50\\\"]]\\n\\n\\ndef test_csv_empty_database(tmp_path):\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.export_csv(tmp_path / \\\"missing.json\\\", out)\\n    assert read_csv(out) == [[\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"], [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"0.00\\\"]]\\n\\n\\ndef test_csv_negative_net(tmp_path):\\n    db, out = tmp_path / \\\"db.json\\\", tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.add_record(db, \\\"支出\\\", -30)\\n    ledger.export_csv(db, out)\\n    assert read_csv(out)[-1] == [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"-30.00\\\"]\\n    assert ledger.summarize(ledger.load_records(db))[\\\"expense\\\"] == -30\\n\\n\\ndef test_csv_uses_summarize(tmp_path, monkeypatch):\\n    calls = []\\n    def summary(records):\\n        calls.append(records)\\n        return {\\\"income\\\": 0, \\\"expense\\\": 0, \\\"net\\\": 42.25}\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(ledger, \\\"summarize\\\", summary)\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    ledger.export_csv(tmp_path / \\\"missing.json\\\", out)\\n    assert calls == [[]]\\n    assert read_csv(out)[-1] == [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"42.25\\\"]\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 17, \"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger.py\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"read\", \"path\": \"test_ledger.py\"}, \"result\": {\"content\": \"import csv\\n\\nfrom ledger import add_record, load_records, summarize\\n\\n\\ndef export_csv(*args):\\n    # 新功能缺失不应阻止独立验证子任务一。\\n    from ledger import export_csv as implementation\\n    return implementation(*args)\\n\\n\\ndef seed(db):\\n    add_record(db, \\\"工资\\\", 8000)\\n    add_record(db, \\\"房租\\\", -2500)\\n    add_record(db, \\\"餐饮\\\", -300.5)\\n\\n\\ndef test_summarize_net(tmp_path):\\n    db = tmp_path / \\\"l.json\\\"\\n    seed(str(db))\\n    s = summarize(load_records(str(db)))\\n    assert s[\\\"income\\\"] == 8000\\n    assert s[\\\"expense\\\"] == -2800.5\\n    assert round(s[\\\"net\\\"], 2) == 5199.5\\n\\n\\ndef test_summarize_empty(tmp_path):\\n    s = summarize([])\\n    assert s == {\\\"income\\\": 0, \\\"expense\\\": 0, \\\"net\\\": 0}\\n\\n\\ndef test_export_csv_rows(tmp_path):\\n    db = tmp_path / \\\"l.json\\\"\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    seed(str(db))\\n    export_csv(str(db), str(out))\\n    with open(out, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        rows = list(csv.reader(f))\\n    assert rows[0] == [\\\"desc\\\", \\\"amount\\\"]\\n    assert rows[1] == [\\\"工资\\\", \\\"8000.00\\\"]\\n    assert rows[2] == [\\\"房租\\\", \\\"-2500.00\\\"]\\n    assert rows[3] == [\\\"餐饮\\\", \\\"-300.50\\\"]\\n    assert len(rows) == 5\\n\\n\\ndef test_export_csv_net_row(tmp_path):\\n    db = tmp_path / \\\"l.json\\\"\\n    out = tmp_path / \\\"out.csv\\\"\\n    seed(str(db))\\n    export_csv(str(db), str(out))\\n    with open(out, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n        rows = list(csv.reader(f))\\n    assert rows[-1] == [\\\"__net__\\\", \\\"5199.50\\\"]\\n\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 27, \"tool\": \"plan\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"plan\", \"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"done\"}]}, \"result\": {\"items\": [{\"title\": \"修复净额计算\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"新增 CSV 导出\", \"status\": \"done\"}]}}\n\n{\"id\": 20, \"tool\": \"invalid\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": null, \"result\": {\"error\": \"Extra data: line 3 column 1 (char 47)\"}}\n\n{\"id\": 6, \"tool\": \"list\", \"path\": \"\", \"action\": {\"tool\": \"list\"}, \"result\": {\"files\": [\"ledger.py\", \"test_ledger.py\", \"test_ledger_edges.py\"]}}"}], "stream": false, "temperature": 0, "response_format": {"type": "json_object"}, "max_tokens": 4096}}
